## The harness world for scripts/check-chord-snippets.cjs.
##
## A fragment in the manual leaves out what the reader already has: a header,
## a player, and the places and people its lines mention. This file supplies
## those, one top-level block each. The checker drops any block a fence
## defines itself, so the fence's own version is the one that loads.
##
## The names are the ones the chapters' side examples use (the Yard, the
## Shed, the Den) and the Relighting names a fragment may mention without
## creating. Nothing here is story content; it is scaffolding for a check.

